{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320819001:1":{"text":"무슨 일이야? 어디 보자...","source_cn":"出什么事了，让我来看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F4BEC5C6F30E126","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320819002:1":{"text":"용광로의 축이 멈췄다고? 관도 막혔어? 여기 책임자가 누구야?!","source_cn":"熔炉的轴承怎么卡住了？管道都堵了！谁是这里的负责人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEECA8E69881F846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320819003:1":{"text":"나, 나야... 하지만 들어보라고! 이제 막 교대한 거긴 하지만 모든 과정은 작업 절차랑 매뉴얼에 따라서 정확하게 진행했어!","source_cn":"是……是我，但是你听我说！我虽然刚刚来换班，但我是完全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1888CD4D6F07D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320819004:1":{"text":"무슨 절차! 관이 막혔는데 계속 가열하고 있는 거 안 보여? 이러면 용광로가 폭발할 수도 있다고!","source_cn":"什么流程！你没看到管道堵住了吗？还在加温？这样下去会炸炉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x632837B208ED5C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320819005:1":{"text":"하지만... 교대했던 사람이 일정한 시간에 원료를 넣기만 하면 된다고 그랬어. 다른 작업은 하지 말라고 했는데!","source_cn":"但……和我交接的人是这么说的，他告诉我只要按时进料就行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD295193F3EFD4B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320819006:1":{"text":"뭐?! 예상하지 못한 사고 앞에서는 어떤 절차든 다 바뀔 수 있어! 안전이 제일이라고!","source_cn":"什么？！在可能出现的工程事故面前，任何流程都可以终止与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D894700E3CF466D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320819007:1":{"text":"그치만...","source_cn":"可是……<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB1CE5FAA41CD4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320819008:1":{"text":"그치만은 또 무슨 그치만이야? 문제를 해결하지 않고 절차만 따르겠다고? 그런 태도로 기술자를 할 거면 집에 가서 양이나 키워!","source_cn":"可是什么？遇到问题不解决问题，一味死板地执行，你还做什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB336C25029BC55F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320819009:1":{"text":"...후긴, 후긴! 들어봐요. 뭔가 이상한 소리가 들려요.","source_cn":"……呼金，呼金，你听，好像有什么奇怪的声音……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC29EEBD5DB7B20E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320819010:1":{"text":"젠장! 배기 시스템이 한계치에 가까워졌어! 빨리 압력을 낮춰야 해!","source_cn":"——糟糕！排气系统快到阈值了！我们得抓紧泄压！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C0A8364D8CB6A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320819011:1":{"text":"으악, 어떻게 해야 하지?","source_cn":"啊！我该怎么做！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4729ACF1D956E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320819012:1":{"text":"저리 비켜! 우리가 하는 걸 얌전히 보기나 하라고. 혼나는 건 그다음이야!","source_cn":"站在一边，看我们操作！一会儿我再教训你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E670D61388FDF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320819013:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 긴급 상황이야. 좀 도와줘!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE9D48F0AC6A65EB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 긴급 상황이야. 좀 도와줘!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 긴급 상황이야. 좀 도와줘!","variant_male_record_index":"144985","variant_female_record_index":"144986","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320819014:1":{"text":"내가 먼저 용광로의 압력을 낮출게. 문제를 완전히 해결하려면 관을 뚫을 윤활제를 만들어야 해. 필요한 건... <style=\"highlight\">프로스트 구스베리</style>! 그리고 <style=\"highlight\">크세로네 열매</style>야!","source_cn":"我先给熔炉泄压，要彻底解决问题，需要一种调和润滑剂来疏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BC4F6816593FEDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320819015:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\"